# Dependency Graph

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph contracts["contracts/ (No Dependencies)"]
        IPlugin[IPlugin]
        IEvent[IEventPublisher/Subscriber]
        IAudio[IAudioSource/Sink]
        IStorage[IStorage]
        IHealth[IHealthChecker]
        IMetrics[IMetricsCollector]
    end

    subgraph core["core/ (Depends on contracts)"]
        Engine[EventEngine]
        Pipeline[Pipeline]
        Bus[EventBus]
        Registry[Registry]
        History[History]
        Hooks[Hooks]
    end

    subgraph database["database/ (Depends on core)"]
        Session[SessionManager]
        Repo[BaseRepository]
    end

    subgraph models["models/ (Depends on core)"]
        Event[Event Model]
        Incident[Incident Model]
    end

    subgraph services["services/ (Depends on database)"]
        EventService[EventService]
    end

    subgraph api["api/ (Depends on services)"]
        Routes[APIRoutes]
    end

    contracts --> core
    core --> database
    core --> models
    database --> services
    models --> services
    services --> api

    style contracts fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#4caf50
    style core fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#2196f3
    style database fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style api fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#e91e63
```

## Dependency Rules

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Layers
        L1[contracts]
        L2[core]
        L3[database/models]
        L4[services]
        L5[api]
    end

    L1 --> L2
    L2 --> L3
    L3 --> L4
    L4 --> L5

    style L1 fill:#c8e6c9
    style L2 fill:#e1f5fe
    style L3 fill:#e1f5fe
    style L4 fill:#fff3e0
    style L5 fill:#fce4ec
```

